hpc:Assocmaxcpuminutesperjoblimit a owl:Class .
hpc:Assocmaxcpuperjob a owl:Class .
hpc:Assocmaxcpupernode a owl:Class .
hpc:Assocmaxenergyminutesperjob a owl:Class .
hpc:Assocmaxenergyperjob a owl:Class .
